# ============================================
# SETUP INSTRUCTIONS FOR NEW DEVICES
# ============================================
# 
# 1. Install dependencies (run this first):
#    npm install
#
# 2. Installed libraries:
#    - React ^19.2.5 (UI framework)
#    - React Router DOM ^7.14.2 (routing)
#    - Firebase ^12.12.1 (backend & database)
#    - OpenAI ^6.37.0 (AI/GPT features)
#    - Lucide React ^1.14.0 (icons)
#    - Vite ^8.0.10 (build tool)
#    - ESLint ^10.2.1 (code linting)
#
# 3. Add environment variables below:
# ============================================

# OpenAI Configuration
# Get your API key from https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
VITE_OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here

# Firebase Configuration (optional - defaults are provided)
# Get these from your Firebase project settings
# VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=your_firebase_api_key
# VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=your_project.firebaseapp.com
# VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=your_project_id
# VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=your_project.appspot.com
# VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=123456789
# VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=1:123456789:web:abcdef123456
# VITE_FIREBASE_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX
